column3:
During the <style=Hint_BgL>calming phase</style>, you can use Aniipods (except Sparkling Cubes and Tumblers) to calm Legendary Aniimo and increase Calming Progress.
Press the <style=Hint_BgL>Rules</style> button in the upper-right corner of the screen to view the full rules. Each Aniipod restores Calming Progress as follows:

<sprite name="ui_item_110003_small"><style=Q_5>Aniipod Ultra</style>: Restores 20 Calm points;
<sprite name="ui_item_110007_small"><style=Q_4>Aniipod Mega</style>: Restores 1 Calm point;
<sprite name="ui_item_110005_small"><style=Q_4>Aniipod Trace</style>: Restores 1 Calm point;
<sprite name="ui_item_110004_small"><style=Q_4>Aniipod Hyper</style>: Restores 1 Calm point;
<sprite name="ui_item_110002_small"><style=Q_4>Aniipod Pro</style>: Restores 0.75 Calm points;
<sprite name="ui_item_110001_small"><style=Q_3>Aniipod</style>: Restores 0.5 Calm points.
